      "name": "SamSWAT's IncreasedFOV (3.11)",
      "slug": "samswats-increasedfov-311",
      "teaser": "BepInEx plugin that allows increasing the FOV past the default 75 as well as offset the head camera",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2749.png",
      "downloads": 13244,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<p>Reupload for <strong>3.11</strong> due to demand - <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/733-increased-fov\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">see the original IncreasedFOV modpage</a></p>\n<p><em><strong>No support given since I am not the author</strong></em></p>\n<h3><strong>Available mod settings</strong> (Hotkey: F12)</h3>\n<p>Setting Range (<strong>value</strong>) Horizontal HUD FOV Value -0.1 to 0.1 (<strong>default: 0.05</strong>) Vertical HUD FOV Value -0.1 to 0.1 (<strong>default: 0.05</strong>) Max FOV Value 1 to 150 (<strong>Default: 150</strong>) Min FOV Value 1 to 149 (<strong>Default: 20</strong>) ### <strong>Comparison image for the HUD offset options</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/3WYdjuz.jpeg\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3WYdjuz.jpeg\" alt=\"3WYdjuz.jpeg\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p>Values used for the altered offset:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Horizontal offset: <strong>-0.01</strong></li>\n<li>Vertical offset: <strong>0.065</strong></li>\n<li>FOV: <strong>80</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Installation</strong></h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the mod</li>\n<li>Open the archive <code>SamSWAT.FOV.zip</code> with <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://7-zip.org/download.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">7-Zip</a></li>\n<li>Drag and drop the <code>BepInEx</code> folder into your main SPT folder (where SPT.Server.exe is)</li>\n<li>Profit</li>\n</ol>\n<h3><strong>Demonstration video (yes, it’s from SAIN, just do what is being shown)</strong></h3>\n",
